    blk(&mut d, "p", "Totals over all years for each focal study: the citations the authors reviewed; the rebuilt citations in years with a nonzero rate, where a numerator sets the count (the remainder was spread over the zero-rate years); the sum of rebuilt unsupported citations; and the unsupported total in the paper's table. Derived values only.");
